Quest Rescue The Grunts Grunt Unhide Loop
    Events
        Time - Every 1.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
    Actions
        For each (Integer UpsideGruntLoopInteger) from 1 to UpsideGrunt_Index, do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Set VariableSet UpsideGrunt_Counter[UpsideGruntLoopInteger] = (UpsideGrunt_Counter[UpsideGruntLoopInteger] + 1)
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        UpsideGrunt_Counter[UpsideGruntLoopInteger] Greater than or equal to 240
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Unhide UpsideGrunt[UpsideGruntLoopInteger]
                        Set VariableSet UpsideGrunt[UpsideGruntLoopInteger] = UpsideGrunt[UpsideGrunt_Index]
                        Set VariableSet UpsideGrunt_Counter[UpsideGruntLoopInteger] = UpsideGrunt_Counter[UpsideGrunt_Index]
                        Set VariableSet UpsideGrunt_Index = (UpsideGrunt_Index - 1)
                        Set VariableSet UpsideGruntLoopInteger = (UpsideGruntLoopInteger - 1)
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                UpsideGrunt_Index Equal to 0
                            Then - Actions
                                Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
                            Else - Actions
                    Else - Actions
